Run `rubylith` on any site and it screenshots the page, has an AI model critique the design, and pulls out its design tokens as CSS variables, a Tailwind config and JSON. It can also generate React and Tailwind components from what it sees. It supports several models (v0, GPT-4, Claude) and falls back automatically when one is down. Named after the masking film designers once cut by hand.
